<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ASE Test raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ASE Test raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen &amp; Co said on Wednesday it had raised its rating for ASE Test Ltd to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the company were off 3/8 to 22-5/8 in late-morning trade.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
